hideReadTime: true
title: Conferences & events
description: Upcoming ME/CFS and Long COVID research conferences, patient events and awareness days, plus recordings of past conferences you can watch from home.
reviewed: 2026-09-29
brief:
  - Many research conferences now **stream online** or post **free recordings**, which is ideal if travel isn't possible.
